---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Us | ApprovedDecorators">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 prose prose-blue">
    <h1>About ApprovedDecorators</h1>
    <p class="lead">We are the UK's most trusted network of vetted painting and decorating professionals.</p>
    
    <h2>Our Vetting Process</h2>
    <p>We don't just let anyone join our platform. Every decorator must pass our strict vetting process:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Insurance Verification:</strong> Must hold active £2M+ Public Liability Insurance.</li>
      <li><strong>Trade Experience:</strong> Minimum of 5 years verifiable experience in the trade.</li>
      <li><strong>Portfolio Review:</strong> Comprehensive review of past projects and finishes.</li>
      <li><strong>Customer Referrals:</strong> Direct verification with previous clients.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>To bring transparency, reliability, and guaranteed quality to the painting and decorating industry across every major city and borough in the UK.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
